{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07653","headline":"题衡阳泗州寺 · 张拚","name":"题衡阳泗州寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一水悠悠百粤通，片帆无奈信秋风。\n几层峡浪寒舂月，尽日江天雨打篷。\n漂泊渐摇青草外，乡关谁念雪园东。\n未知今夜依何处，一点渔灯出苇丛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张拚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07653.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07653","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}